  (text "What this does: Gets satellite position and time from an antenna mounted outside the carbon airframe.\nConnects to: Passive antenna/SMA -> MAX-M10S -> comms UART, pulse-per-second and reset. Power needs both battery-valid and the comms request. No antenna bias or ANT_CHECK."
    (at 15.24 27.94 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "2ba216ac-ae10-5d24-9b83-64fdf11a585c")))
